Algorithm 2 The KCPG algorithm
Input: Node set U, charging distance D;
Output: The charging position set L.
1: Initialize j=1;
2: while true do
3: G= Kmeans(U, j);
4: {L, RM}= Optimiz(G);
5: return L if r≤D ∀r∈RM otherwise j=j+1;
6: end while
